OL,5,G0100 #Text Me When You Get Home
OL,6,     FJustina Rucinski, who has a home
OL,7,     Fbaking business in Iowa, receives
OL,8,     Fan email order. But when the
OL,9,     Fcustomer arrives to leave the
OL,10,     Fdeposit, she is brutally attacked
OL,11,     Fand taken at gunpoint.
OL,12,G0155 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FTwo grooms-to-be come to the
OL,14,     Fclinic with lumps they want to get
OL,15,     Frid of before their big days: Carl
OL,16,     Fhas multiple lipomas, while Alan
OL,17,     Fneeds a neck cyst removed.
